server: Run wineserver as a thread of the app.

The app links libwineserver.a and starts it through wineserver_inproc_main
(ios_inproc.c); it stays up when its last client disconnects. mach.c
works on the app's own task. A process killed in-process is reported
through process_died, and the first process gets a full administrator
token that its children inherit. wineserver_inproc_user_processes tells
the app how many programs run. The server directory lives in the prefix
and NLS files come from WINEDATADIR. request.c counts requests at
KITSUNE_DIAG_LEVEL, named by trace.c.
